> ### Name: parsePairs
> ### Title: Parse key-value pairs from a character string
> ### Aliases: parsePairs
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> 
> parsePairs("A=3,B=4,C=5", collapse=",", sep="=")
    key value
A=3   A     3
B=4   B     4
C=5   C     5
> parsePairs("A:3|B:4|C:5", collapse="|", sep=":")
   key value
1    A  <NA>
2       <NA>
3    3  <NA>
4    |  <NA>
5    B  <NA>
6       <NA>
7    4  <NA>
8    |  <NA>
9    C  <NA>
10      <NA>
11   5  <NA>
> 
